PegResponsiveIrm::onMarketPause(bool)
├── given caller is not the bound market
│   ├── when market is unset, caller is owner, caller is pending owner, or caller is any other address
│   │   └── it should revert with IrmUnauthorized
│   ├── it should reject before inspecting paused or casting block.timestamp
│   ├── it should leave the complete IRState unchanged
│   └── it should not emit events or read the oracle
└── given caller is the bound market
    ├── when paused is true
    │   ├── when block.timestamp is greater than type(uint48).max
    │   │   └── it should still succeed because the timestamp is not cast
    │   ├── it should leave borrowRate, lastUpdate, recoveryStartedAt and stressMode unchanged
    │   ├── it should not inspect whether the market is actually paused
    │   └── it should not emit events or read the oracle
    └── when paused is false
        ├── when block.timestamp is greater than type(uint48).max
        │   ├── it should revert with SafeCastOverflowedUintDowncast(48, block.timestamp)
        │   ├── it should preserve any active recovery confirmation
        │   └── it should not emit events
        └── when block.timestamp fits uint48
            ├── when block.timestamp is zero or type(uint48).max
            │   └── it should accept the exact boundary timestamp
            ├── given recoveryStartedAt is zero
            │   ├── it should set lastUpdate to block.timestamp
            │   ├── it should preserve borrowRate and stressMode
            │   ├── it should emit exactly IRStateUpdated with the resulting state
            │   └── it should not emit StressStateUpdated or BorrowRateUpdated
            └── given recoveryStartedAt is non-zero
                ├── it should set lastUpdate to block.timestamp
                ├── it should clear recoveryStartedAt
                ├── it should preserve borrowRate and stressMode
                ├── it should emit StressStateUpdated(stressMode, 0, 0)
                ├── it should then emit IRStateUpdated with the resulting state
                ├── it should not emit BorrowRateUpdated
                └── it should not read the oracle or refresh the borrow rate
